//////////////////////////////////////////
//              Game Modes              //
//////////////////////////////////////////


// # Warning
// - Replace "XXX" with "SC" or "HC".
//   * "SC" is Default and "HC" is Hardcore.
// - Don't forget that the .dsr files are game modes (with their settings), if you don't have a file named "Example.dsr" you shouldn't put "Example" in the rotation.
// - You can edit the .dsr files with a text editor, if you want to change settings, such as time limit etc.


// # Standard
// - Free For All        =  FFA-XXX
// - Team Deathmatch     =  TDM-XXX
// - Search and Destroy  =  SD-XXX
// - Sabotage            =  SAB-XXX
// - Domination          =  DOM-XXX
// - Headquarters        =  HQ-XXX
// - Capture The Flag    =  CTF-XXX
// - Demolition          =  DD-XXX
// - Kill Confirmed      =  KC-XXX
// - Team Defender       =  TDEF-XXX


// # Alternative
// - Drop Zone           =  DZ-XXX
// - Team Juggernaut     =  TJ-XXX
// - Juggernaut          =  JUG-XXX
// - Gun Game            =  GG-XXX
// - Infected            =  INF-XXX
// - One In The Chamber  =  OIC-XXX



////////////////////////////////////////
//              Rotation              //
////////////////////////////////////////


// # Format for a map rotation entry is:
//
// - <Map Name>, <Game Mode DSR>, <Probability>
//   - Map Names are listed above, starting with "mp_".
//   - Game Mode DSR's that are included in this package of configuration files are listed above too.
//   - Probability: 1 - 1000 (selection is weighted random - higher values increase selection chance).
//
// - Below is an example of map rotation.
// - Edit this map rotation according to your preferences with your maps and game modes.
//
// - By default, the map rotation is more or less random.
// - If you want the maps to rotate in a fixed order, set the DVAR "sv_fixedMapRotation" to "1" in your Server.cfg
//
// - You can only put up to 16 maps maximum!


